# The organizers' validator clones this repo and runs generation twice on LINUX, byte-comparing the
# output. Anything that lets a line ending shift between platforms is a reproducibility hazard, so
# every text file in this repo is stored and checked out as LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.fasta text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.toml  text eol=lf
*.lock  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
